      "type": "af-hero",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "The science · Ingredient index",
        "heading": "Your results can only be as good as what you can absorb.",
        "text": "<p>Welcome to our Ingredient Index, your ultimate guide to understanding the components that make up our products. At Aegis Formulas, we believe in transparency and empowering our customers to make informed choices about what they put on their bodies.</p><p>Each ingredient included in our formulations undergoes rigorous evaluation to ensure safety, efficacy, and sustainability. In this index, you'll find information about each ingredient we use, including its purpose and benefits.</p><p>We're committed to selecting ingredients that meet the highest standards of quality and integrity. With our Ingredient Index, you can trust that every element in our formulations has been carefully chosen to deliver results you can see and feel.</p>",
